ly kill you.\" Said [the former], \"Indeed, Allāh only accepts from the righteous [who fear Him].","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"5:28","t":"If you should raise your hand toward me to kill me - I shall not raise my hand toward you to kill you. Indeed, I fear Allāh, Lord of the worlds.","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"5:29","t":"Indeed, I want you to obtain [thereby] my sin and your sin so you will be among the companions of the Fire. And that is the recompense of wrongdoers.\"","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"5:30","t":"And his soul permitted to him the murder of his brother, so he killed him and became among the losers.","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"5:31","t":"Then Allāh sent a crow searching [i.e., scratching] in the ground to show him how to hide the disgrace of his brother. He said, \"O woe to me! Have I failed to be like this crow and hide the disgrace [i.e., body] of my brother?\" And he became of the regretful.","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":31,"sd":null}],"juz":6,"hizb":11,"surahs":[5],"sajdah":false}